# Test: daemon start leaves fib kernel alone off under interface backend vpp and reports doctor-dataplane-mismatch.
# Question: does `ze start` on a file with `interface backend vpp` and
#           `fib kernel` alone (no `fib vpp` block) reach "Ze running", leave
#           `fib kernel` off and reported under `doctor-dataplane-mismatch`
#           naming `fib kernel` and `set fib vpp`, and keep the config file
#           untouched, while `ze config validate` still refuses the file?
# VALIDATES: 2026-11-26 owner ruling, Answer 2a
#            (plan/records/ruling-ze-always-starts.md) and
#            spec-dataplane-compatibility-guard AC-14 -- a host-side FIB writer
#            of another plane alone under VPP is left off at daemon start and
#            reported under `doctor-dataplane-mismatch`, while `ze config
#            validate` stays strict.
# PREVENTS: `fib kernel` alone blocking a VPP daemon from starting, or loading
#           `fib-kernel` without `fib-vpp` at boot, or rewriting disk config.

option=needs-build-tag:value=ze_vpp:state=present
option=env:var=ze.log.fib.kernel:value=info

tmpfs=vpp-fib-kernel-alone.conf:refused=config-plugin-verify:terminator=EOF_CONF
interface {
	backend vpp;
}
fib {
	kernel {
	}
}
EOF_CONF

# `ze config validate` stays strict and refuses the mismatch.
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze config validate vpp-fib-kernel-alone.conf:timeout=20s
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stdout:contains=fib kernel
expect=stdout:contains=set fib vpp

# Daemon start succeeds, leaves fib kernel off, and reports doctor-dataplane-mismatch.
cmd=background:seq=2:name=daemon:exec=ze start vpp-fib-kernel-alone.conf:ready=Ze running
expect=stderr:contains=that feature is left off; ze and its other services keep running
expect=stderr:contains=code=doctor-dataplane-mismatch
expect=stderr:contains=fib kernel
expect=stderr:contains=set fib vpp
reject=stderr:contains=error: load config:
reject=stderr:contains=fib-kernel: running
reject=stderr:contains=fib-kernel:
reject=stderr:pattern=panic

cmd=stop:seq=3:name=daemon:signal=term

# Stored config file on disk stays untouched: validate still sees the mismatch.
cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=ze config validate vpp-fib-kernel-alone.conf:timeout=20s
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stdout:contains=set fib vpp
